<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
  <title>COCOCE · Authentication Terms</title>
  <meta name="description" content="COCOCE Authentication Terms — Data accuracy, internal sharing, account responsibility, and urgent support. COCOCE Kigali Rwanda.">
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">

  <meta property="og:image" content="https://cdn.cococe.rw/branding/brand/logos/cococe.png">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.cococe.rw">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Laptops, Printers, Accessories, Game consoles, Electronics, and much more, cococe, your wish our priority">
  <meta property="og:description" content="COCOCE Kigali Rwanda, Laptops, Desktops, Computer accessories, Smart tv, projectors, discover what you want about digital assets near you at Kigali">
  <meta property="og:logo" content="https://cdn.cococe.rw/branding/brand/logos/cococe.png" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="https://cdn.cococe.rw/branding/brand/logos/cococe.png">
  <meta property="twitter:domain" content="https://cococe.rw">
  <meta property="twitter:url" content="https://cococe.rw">
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="Laptops, Printers, Accessories, Game consoles, Electronics, and much more, cococe, your wish our priority">
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="COCOCE Kigali Rwanda, Laptops, Desktops, Computer accessories, Smart tv, projectors, discover what you want about digital assets near you at Kigali">

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:opsz,wght@14..32,300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/main.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/at-terms.css">
</head>

<body>

  <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 border-b border-ink-200/70 bg-white/85 backdrop-blur no-print">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 h-14 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
      <a href="<%= locals.protocal %><%= locals.domainName %>" class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-shrink-0">
        <img src="/images/logos/business.png" alt="COCOCE" class="h-7">
      </a>
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <a href="<%= locals.protocal %>business.<%= locals.domainName %>/dashboard" class="hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium text-ink-700 hover:bg-ink-100 transition" target="_blank">
          <i data-lucide="layout-dashboard" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
          Dashboard
        </a>
        <a href="<%= locals.protocal %>admin.<%= locals.domainName %>/dashboard" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-brand text-white text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-brand-dark transition">
          <i data-lucide="shield-cog-corner" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
          Admin Dashboard
        </a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-8 sm:pt-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand">Authentication Terms</p>
      <h1 class="mt-1 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-900">
        Terms of use. You agree, we protect.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base text-ink-500 leading-relaxed">
        By creating an account, signing in, or using COCOCE authentication services, you are bound
        to the terms below. Please read carefully — they explain your responsibilities and ours.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-xs text-ink-400">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <i data-lucide="calendar" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
          Last updated: <%= locals.updatedAt || 'Latest' %>
        </span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <i data-lucide="globe" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
          Applies to: cococe.rw and all subdomains
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10 sm:py-12 grid lg:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] gap-8">

    <aside class="hidden lg:block no-print">
      <nav class="sticky top-20 text-sm" aria-label="On this page">
        <p class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-ink-400 mb-3">On this page</p>
        <ul class="space-y-0.5">
          <li><a href="#acceptance-auth" class="toc-link block border-l-2 border-transparent pl-3 py-1.5 text-ink-500 hover:text-ink-900 transition">1. Acceptance</a></li>
          <li><a href="#data-accuracy" class="toc-link block border-l-2 border-transparent pl-3 py-1.5 text-ink-500 hover:text-ink-900 transition">2. Data accuracy</a></li>
          <li><a href="#internal-sharing" class="toc-link block border-l-2 border-transparent pl-3 py-1.5 text-ink-500 hover:text-ink-900 transition">3. Avoid internal data sharing</a></li>
          <li><a href="#account-responsibility" class="toc-link block border-l-2 border-transparent pl-3 py-1.5 text-ink-500 hover:text-ink-900 transition">4. Account responsibility</a></li>
          <li><a href="#prohibited-auth" class="toc-link block border-l-2 border-transparent pl-3 py-1.5 text-ink-500 hover:text-ink-900 transition">5. Prohibited activities</a></li>
          <li><a href="#termination-auth" class="toc-link block border-l-2 border-transparent pl-3 py-1.5 text-ink-500 hover:text-ink-900 transition">6. Termination</a></li>
          <li><a href="#changes-auth" class="toc-link block border-l-2 border-transparent pl-3 py-1.5 text-ink-500 hover:text-ink-900 transition">7. Changes to terms</a></li>
          <li><a href="#urgent-help" class="toc-link block border-l-2 border-transparent pl-3 py-1.5 text-ink-500 hover:text-ink-900 transition">8. Urgent help</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contact-auth" class="toc-link block border-l-2 border-transparent pl-3 py-1.5 text-ink-500 hover:text-ink-900 transition">9. Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </aside>

    <article class="prose-doc min-w-0">

      <section id="acceptance-auth">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink-900 mb-3">1. Acceptance of terms</h2>
        <p>
          By creating an account, signing in, or using COCOCE authentication services, you confirm
          that you have read, understood, and agreed to these authentication terms. If you do not
          agree, please do not use the service.
        </p>
        <div class="bg-brand-light rounded-3xl p-5 md:p-6 border-l-4 border-brand flex items-center gap-4 shadow-sm my-4">
          <i data-lucide="handshake" class="w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 text-brand flex-shrink-0"></i>
          <div class="text-slate-800">
            <strong>By using / creating / signing in</strong> to a COCOCE account, you confirm
            that you have read, understood, and agreed to these authentication terms. If you do
            not agree, please do not use the service.
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="data-accuracy" class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink-900 mb-3">2. Data accuracy</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>You agree to provide <strong>accurate, current, and complete</strong> information during registration and keep it updated.</li>
          <li>False, misleading, or impersonating details may result in <strong>immediate account suspension</strong>.</li>
          <li>You are responsible for any activity that occurs under your account due to inaccurate data.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="internal-sharing" class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink-900 mb-3">3. Avoid internal data sharing</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>You must <strong>not share, sell, or redistribute</strong> any internal COCOCE data, credentials, or session tokens.</li>
          <li>Sharing your login details with third parties violates these terms and compromises security.</li>
          <li>Any unauthorized sharing may lead to <strong>permanent account termination</strong> and legal action.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="account-responsibility" class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink-900 mb-3">4. Account responsibility</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>You are solely responsible for <strong>maintaining the confidentiality</strong> of your password and session.</li>
          <li>Notify us immediately of any <strong>unauthorized use</strong> or suspected breach of your account.</li>
          <li>We are not liable for losses caused by your failure to secure your credentials.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="prohibited-auth" class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink-900 mb-3">5. Prohibited activities</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Attempting to <strong>bypass, hack, or exploit</strong> authentication mechanisms is strictly forbidden.</li>
          <li>Using automated scripts, bots, or scrapers against the auth system is not allowed.</li>
          <li>Any form of <strong>phishing, social engineering, or credential theft</strong> will be prosecuted.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="termination-auth" class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink-900 mb-3">6. Termination</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to <strong>suspend or terminate</strong> your account at any time
          if you violate these terms or pose a security risk.
        </p>
        <p>
          You may also delete your account at any time; however, certain data may be retained for
          legal or security purposes.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="changes-auth" class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink-900 mb-3">7. Changes to terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of COCOCE after changes
          constitutes <strong>acceptance of the new terms</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Material changes will be communicated via email or a prominent notice on our platform.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="urgent-help" class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink-900 mb-3">8. Need urgent help?</h2>
        <div class="bg-[#fff8ee] rounded-3xl p-5 md:p-7 border border-[#ffd8b5] shadow-md shadow-amber-200/20">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xl font-semibold text-[#9b4a0e] mb-5">
            <i data-lucide="alert-circle" class="w-6 h-6 text-[#b55a1a]"></i>
            ⚠️ If you suspect your account has been compromised
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-800 mb-4">
            If you suspect your account has been compromised, notice unauthorized activity, or
            need immediate assistance with authentication issues — <strong>do not wait</strong>.
            Call us directly.
          </p>

          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-4 flex-wrap py-3">
            <a href="/account-suspension-appeal" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-black text-white font-bold transition hover:-translate-y-0.5">
              <i data-lucide="shield-off" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
              Suspend Account
            </a>
            <a href="tel:+250787195425" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#007BFF] text-white font-bold transition hover:-translate-y-0.5">
              <i data-lucide="phone" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
              Help line
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-5 bg-white rounded-2xl px-4 py-3.5 flex items-center gap-3 text-[#a13d0a] border border-dashed border-[#d97c38]">
            <i data-lucide="shield-virus" class="w-6 h-6 text-[#c9621e] flex-shrink-0"></i>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium">For account breaches, stolen credentials, or suspicious login alerts, call our security team immediately. Every minute matters. We are available 24/7 for urgent authentication issues.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 mt-4">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-[#d0e6d9] text-[#0e4f2e] rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold">
              <i data-lucide="check-circle" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i> 24/7 Security Response
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-[#d0e6d9] text-[#0e4f2e] rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold">
              <i data-lucide="check-circle" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i> Immediate Account Lock
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-[#d0e6d9] text-[#0e4f2e] rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold">
              <i data-lucide="check-circle" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i> Guided Recovery
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="contact-auth" class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink-900 mb-3">9. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these authentication terms may be sent to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>General support — <a href="mailto:support@cococe.rw" class="contact-link">sales@cococe.rw</a></li>
          <li>Security concerns — <a href="mailto:security@cococe.rw" class="contact-link">sales@cococe.rw</a></li>
          <li>Urgent authentication issues — <a href="tel:+250787195425" class="contact-link">+250 787 195 425</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-ink-200">
        <p class="text-xs text-ink-400">
          This document is provided for informational purposes and does not constitute legal
          advice. COCOCE recommends that users seek independent legal advice where appropriate.
          If anything here conflicts with mandatory law, the law prevails.
        </p>
      </section>

    </article>
  </div>

  <footer class="border-t border-ink-200 bg-white/60 no-print">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs text-ink-400">
      <span>© 2026 <span class="text-brand font-extrabold">COCOCE</span> — Authentication Terms</span>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 justify-center">
        <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-brand transition">Terms</a>
        <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-brand transition">Privacy</a>
        <a href="mailto:sales@cococe.rw" class="hover:text-brand transition">Support</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    lucide.createIcons();
  </script>

  <script src="/scripts/at-terms.js"></script>

</body>

</html>